{
  "id": "628ea7936db60e2d5b0b1dd3",
  "title": "快打旋风3",
  "summary": "这次选个直截了当的游戏清清脑子。 作为卡婊清版动作类的开山鼻祖，《快打旋风》 除了初代在各个平台疯狂炒冷饭以外，更多的是利用了角色的剩余价值。哈格、艾迪科迪、凯，乃至敌方角色苏杜姆、罗兰多、艾迪、毒药、安德鲁都在另外的卡普空宇宙中疯狂出场，但自身的正宗续作《快打旋风2》《快打旋风3》的自身水准和外部评价都不太高。3代比2代强一点。 这次玩的3代，在系统上对比1代其实改进非常多：加入了搓招、跑动攻击、超必杀，流畅性对比难度贼高的1代提升很大。但要说多好玩呢，也并没有。3代是超任独占的，家用机的性能决定了同屏敌人最多4个，再难能难哪去？倒是我选的露西亚贫攻，常常出现因时间不够而引起的恐慌。 本来我玩游戏都是首选日版，其次美版。但这个游戏强烈推荐欧版。按住SELECT进入标题画面，后面就谁用谁知道了。 搓招意义不太…",
  "content": "<p><a href=\"https://pewae.com/gayn/86c0012cb38d5bc9d9081718f4591b1c678a908cd7654f282de7c9a67761acfdc343ff4af0016f2eed1911d7d186fc6fbb1a70a7961685f6184a154f2d4068eb54\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">快打旋风3</a></p>\n<p>这次选个直截了当的游戏清清脑子。</p>\n<p><a href=\"https://pewae.com/gayn/42ab72ea0e39ca43bb8085d11934d93d6b2b07de7de8045868f5f5f93d61056f7c1fea5dd2e13bbb3347299baedb4f2e0812e779001ceb7c4b15f244f6b37d8d7ab0f5ead412999a7061be245af74a\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><img alt=\"Final_Fight_3_043\"></a></p>\n<p>作为卡婊清版动作类的开山鼻祖，《快打旋风》<sup><a href=\"https://pewae.com/gayn/a27a87eb055c2faee56ff68175ff94010ebceec0b379bc5243380eb6426838914653c2362d87c84542d878\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">[2]</a></sup> 除了初代在各个平台疯狂炒冷饭以外，更多的是利用了角色的剩余价值。哈格、<del>艾迪</del>科迪、凯，乃至敌方角色苏杜姆、罗兰多、艾迪、毒药、安德鲁都在另外的卡普空宇宙中疯狂出场，但自身的正宗续作《快打旋风2》《快打旋风3》的自身水准和外部评价都不太高。3代比2代强一点。<br>\n<a href=\"https://pewae.com/gayn/58dd5e0e3f1adcbe6a27b2928c7223efac944eaa4a1a6aacef2a4e94da8ab10cd59f83c0c5abf76a1e9c19e8d6043d6c9ede6d486e7954f69719bf08999986aeada8cddf20c4c7131f2212d4ffe63b\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><img alt=\"Final_Fight_3_000\"></a></p>\n<p>这次玩的3代，在系统上对比1代其实改进非常多：加入了搓招、跑动攻击、超必杀，流畅性对比难度贼高的1代提升很大。但要说多好玩呢，也并没有。3代是超任独占的，家用机的性能决定了同屏敌人最多4个，再难能难哪去？倒是我选的露西亚贫攻，常常出现因时间不够而引起的恐慌。<br>\n<a href=\"https://pewae.com/gayn/a2a9fc6bdf9096910093eff421ae202eb99f319e1410381916fd26fdd8058bce76600d96ceda833092208ca723fd0c8ca9788a00c77e8a12bd0e5180e9004f95b53d3b2de788c8814c41d6b36769ee\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><img alt=\"Final_Fight_3_014\"></a></p>\n<p>本来我玩游戏都是首选日版，其次美版。但这个游戏强烈推荐欧版。按住SELECT进入标题画面，后面就谁用谁知道了。<br>\n<a href=\"https://pewae.com/gayn/2a3162daeaa120a5fcbf8667d3b9b230f83a4f3490a2838fe848bc6be5d58b8c365f5ef590efef53ffb101d6c9d1babd694765f64111fbd5bcd6924fe3ab8199f1ca6408fed420a93430f2da35d684\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><img alt=\"Final_Fight_3_008\"></a></p>\n<p>搓招意义不太大，起码对于女主露西亚是这样。升龙腿收招破绽极大，除了耍帅，就只有落地挨揍的用处。而那个SUPER气槽存在的时间又短，BOSS战时难以抓住时机，也是只能装B用。最实用的还是跑动攻击，手速够的话能把敌人连到死，也挺爽。<br>\n<a href=\"https://pewae.com/gayn/3779c16928bca49ffcf9fc1a2536c4bc9b551c232a7801961d8ef423c6a4cc791d2b660e48b573ca59237b7c4182f4369ee8d1ea319f7c5cade9fa4a8433755088d7f4dcda0e02205d6a67ff3e32c2\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><img alt=\"Final_Fight_3_003\"></a></p>\n<p>清版动作最重要的还是那说不清道不明的打击感。本作这方面还行，但从出品时间来看，比对面的格斗四人组系列还是稍逊一筹。<br>\n<a href=\"https://pewae.com/gayn/53dbfee5826dea07c94b7ec2a0f5f5dfb51b2ba258c49e4e29d720e4ca13ac26c0929dac4c657087d373f633d49bb7922c4d8ab3eccc47c99aeefa930b35ce7520547fad5fa28ed4f34267f322f692\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><img alt=\"Final_Fight_3_028\"></a></p>\n<p>分支路线算特色吗？在1995年这个时间点看来不算，只能算“借鉴”来的。但某些路线可以跳过BOSS，也是挺值得的。有一条不太容易出现的路线是唐人街，场景设计还是挺赞的。<br>\n<a href=\"https://pewae.com/gayn/2a78cf8216c15914597dfd70f432777ce559981cbda1efae7f916984beaaaedff041482fbd97e747b7b2539fddd7253b06bf07b47bd7c66b93cf688448eb384d1012ce70b24fc8c5eac1752dea6a82\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><img alt=\"Final_Fight_3_030\"></a></p>\n<p>只是这一关的BOSS嘛，有点刻板印象了。这只BOSS会点穴嘿！<br>\n<a href=\"https://pewae.com/gayn/fba31d254428b37ae99d89abc6878f80668bf3231dcd18dc44f4cd6fc85721945badef33b637305dbcbbddf8ee038df05b2156400e33df792e3c40027f053fcb833564939aad9891f3ac30a047e526\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><img alt=\"Final_Fight_3_063\"></a></p>\n<p>其余的BOSS们。只打一遍可是会认不全的。<br>\n<a href=\"https://pewae.com/gayn/820ca0b94403327d56e9c20f4e832e5ffd0fa3b7cacae9eaba168efdbde6c885e1486ab1d5e13da539507c3a60521f393136c9b38782204eeae6388bf2daf665d3fb9c35543aed45400bac517cd8fb\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><img alt=\"Final_Fight_3_006\"></a><br>\n<a href=\"https://pewae.com/gayn/6f27c101cac110f36b4c4225dc24207bbe46d5f15961e86c1438b2fc6f01f50f769b9b83787974688a31d365ed863ff9543bb2eb429bd4fc5cf7be479cef5e1fcb33a55ae9e5afadf86fe6e3f0a37f\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><img alt=\"Final_Fight_3_010\"></a><br>\n<a href=\"https://pewae.com/gayn/72f8bf80112b05d16575f3b97f3fe407c7e5fecdc53faffa6f5e400f88c12e398fb282d4ae17f11ed6278a01da371f0d7c0dfc6bddf60cfbedd508fe01880f8574ae5360898a1da1d036cc071fb224\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><img alt=\"Final_Fight_3_048\"></a><br>\n<a href=\"https://pewae.com/gayn/f41b5c4a8fb6494688bbbb6e75ab1b0c83df77b2a2432db69795ee6f87dcd51aea6b69e4ddc0bd1ae4b893658f7217435e37920b148e7f37f757f319bb06337e90aa003e2fac09da0114d06950210c\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><img alt=\"Final_Fight_3_012\"></a><br>\n<a href=\"https://pewae.com/gayn/d2536d96e6a91b9b640e36c9261c62352c03deaa14bc04e22a6a23f54576995e5043c9e9948303234ac12a1f082584793d6397ee5fdb168d9eb508314a69accb4be3b1eb94f908957dcf9968d4cc2c\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><img alt=\"Final_Fight_3_019\"></a></p>\n<p>最终BOSS，只要不被抓住，不难。最后死在电网上，哪怕不是在电网这侧打死的，也会强行漂移过去。<br>\n<a href=\"https://pewae.com/gayn/42090bbffb19a423b9fda9c0787ad4c6080ed25b462b54bb927076106884a85be96cdd0775252aec60f4fe7da610e14d30ab78d118ca9dfa1495dcfad7202ab03ba7cbad2f9ee0f17e8dc912170009\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><img alt=\"Final_Fight_3_023\"></a><br>\n<a href=\"https://pewae.com/gayn/db47636501f68403c0d46aef8d216bfb416906a0ce12213293ed507b819799a23e51b5d429037d72a4945137136d511459305a02db769784b935289478b642fcb3ba0519bdcf700821575312dca19e\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><img alt=\"Final_Fight_3_025\"></a></p>\n<p>通关画面，明显男主角金毛的迪恩跟另外三个尿不到一个坑里。迪恩在卡普空后续的其它游戏里再没出现过。<br>\n<a href=\"https://pewae.com/gayn/bda4679a914ade923a7243ecfd6fe1c9487c78e506e3177a4d024b3ce6f112f8d238294aeae176ce01da1a598971f710dcc15350c6e48f29035f1f5c9a761d8f121a31e9c6ce4411cfa3323d64648a\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><img alt=\"Final_Fight_3_031\"></a></p>\n<p>选最高难度才能出现真正的结局，也就是“END”这三个字。不值！<br>\n<a href=\"https://pewae.com/gayn/1665979e590ff008a0e408c9da5c3dc4cc5fbb07ccb6cdae78e0b3d3528b83b1e8b933497dd4de6c9e405933517397ac9e72eb8d9908f8bfc557904d08641aa10d4a9ac41c4dfea54eb98419773fa2\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><img alt=\"Final_Fight_3_033\"></a><br>\n<a href=\"https://pewae.com/gayn/d8416a05f33146d8909ebb0e437e025d941e9264512a1ed8b88f492e4f382ace71bcc8d5903895caa2abe1dea95e733f7755eea813a79cc656279c2da33476a96500607837176c301654d6e12950cf\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><img alt=\"Final_Fight_3_032\"></a></p>\n<hr>\n<div>\n<ul>\n<li><a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">(1)</a>：别问为啥用千问，问就是88VIP快到期了，不愿意多注册国产服务。</li>\n<li><a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">(2)</a>：Street Fighter = 陆港街头霸王=台快打旋风，Final Fight = 陆港快打旋风 = 台街头快打</li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n<div><span>《<a href=\"https://pewae.com/2026/10/final-fight-3.html\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">快打旋风3</a>》采用<a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">署名-非商业性使用-禁止演绎</a>许可协议进行许可。 『<a href=\"https://pewae.com\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">破袜子</a>』期待与您交流。</span><div><div><h3>相关推荐:</h3><ul><li><a href=\"https://pewae.com/2022/11/darkwing-duck.html\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">狡猾飞天德</a><span>[53%]</span></li><li><a href=\"https://pewae.com/2022/08/ninja-ryuuken-den-tomoe.html\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">忍者龙剑传：巴</a><span>[51%]</span></li><li><a href=\"https://pewae.com/2024/03/tenchi-o-kurau-ii-shokatsu-koumei-den.html\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">吞食天地2：诸葛孔明传</a><span>[40%]</span></li><li><a href=\"https://pewae.com/2024/09/mega-man-3.html\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">洛克人3</a><span>[40%]</span></li><li><a href=\"https://pewae.com/2019/05/e-v-o-search-of-enden.html\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">46亿年物语</a><span>[38%]</span></li></ul></div></div></div>",
